\\ge3\\).\n\n5. **Conclusion.**  \n   The only possible numbers of sunny lines are  \n\n   \\[\n   k=0\\qquad\\text{(all lines of slope }-1\\text{)} ,\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   k=1\\qquad\\text{(the explicit construction of step\u202f3)} .\n   \\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{k\\in\\{0,1\\}}\n\\]"
